      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write an improved version of the test with better understandability — splitting the single method into focused test methods with descriptive names and explaining the intent of each assertion.The test compiled successfully. The improved version splits the single `testSince` method into three focused test methods, each with a descriptive name that explains the scenario being tested, and adds brief inline comments clarifying why each assertion holds (`Instant.EPOCH`/`Instant.MIN` are always in the past → non-negative duration; `Instant.MAX` is always in the future → non-positive duration)."
